### 3. entry-10 guard: scripts/check_flag_continuation.py
A physical line whose first token is a bare -flag is the shape of the bug
that cost ~3.2 A100-hours. In a YAML command: scalar it is always the bug;
in a shell script it is only correct when bash itself joins the lines
(trailing backslash, unclosed paren) or when it is a case pattern.
